===Noun===
{{en-noun|adenohypophyses}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The [[anterior]] [[lobe]] of the [[pituitary gland]], producing and secreting several [[peptide]] [[hormone]]s that regulate many physiological processes including [[stress]], [[growth]], and [[reproduction]].

